Now back to `bridgeIn(...)` in RootBridgeAgent we get the `globalAddress` for `_dParams.hToken` (again this is the valid `hToken[0]` address from Branch Chain) and `bridgeToRoot(...)` is called that resides in `RootPort.sol`. 

